{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trouble has  fallen upon King Joy and The Kingdom of Vrila. The Queen has gone missing and Shadows consume the land! Now a mysterious Dark Portal  has appeared in The Royal Garden.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507000/extras/5d45cddc4209fde46cd1a4eb02b87a91.poster.avif?t=1757196007\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507000/extras/5d45cddc4209fde46cd1a4eb02b87a91.apng?t=1757196007\" class=\"bb_img\" width=400 height=75 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture into The Nature Realm which has now been infested by dark memories and unravel the mystery behind the consuming Shadows and The Queens disappearance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507000/extras/1752d41411ae2f7720c629197f20c798.poster.avif?t=1757196007\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507000/extras/1752d41411ae2f7720c629197f20c798.webp?t=1757196007\" class=\"bb_img\" width=748 height=172 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>FEATURES</strong></i></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between color and shadow modes to navigate the game world and solve platforming puzzles.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an overhead world map.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subclass opti